snippet package "Package from source directory"
`!p
import re
file_path = vim.eval("expand('%:p:h')")
match = re.search(r'/src/[^/]+/java/(.+)$', file_path)
snip.rv = 'package ' + match.group(1).replace('/', '.') + ';' if match else ''
`
endsnippet

